Create the database — in psql or pgAdmin, run:
CREATE DATABASE wii_providers;


npm run migrate
npm run seed


npm run dev

Provider registers (POST /api/providers/register)
        ↓
  Status = "pending_verification"
        ↓
Admin logs in  (POST /api/auth/login) → gets a JWT
        ↓
Admin approves or rejects  (PUT /api/providers/:id/verify)
        ↓
  Status = "approved" | "rejected"

